Whitney Hodges: Thank y'all so much for hopping into this meeting. Um, I really don't think that we're gonna need a, uh, a full hour. I really just wanted to kind of, like, get us all in the same room, kind of get us all, um, on the same page.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, and make sure everyone kind of, like, has the, like, I think the just, like, full kind of context of, um, of where I'm coming from. So, um, I'm seeing areas of opportunity for us to just kind of, like, tighten up what we are doing in LeadLock.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, in general, specifically with the Foolproof Follow-Up Advantage offer, which… that is, like, you know, that's… that's included now for anyone who signs on with us as a full-service client.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Whitney Hodges: Essentially. Um, but of course, like, we are, like, selling that in isolation as well for people who just want to onboard for LeadLock. And kind of, like, the gist of, like, what it includes at this point is, um…

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:25.000
Whitney Hodges: you know, an inquiry nurture sequence that really gets people to, like, move towards booking a tour, then a pre-tour email sequence, um, and then a post-tour equal email sequence, um, you know, us setting up, like, their calendars to look pretty for booking tours, um, things, things like that.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.000
Whitney Hodges: Umm.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:42.000
Whitney Hodges: I want us to kind of focus on, I think, venues specifically for now, just kind of, like, in terms of, like, this exercise and what we're updating here, because that is, I think, what we're seeing, um, as far as the…

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:55.000
Whitney Hodges: majority, or really all of, kind of, uh, for the most part, are new clients who are onboarding for full-service ads, but then, of course, like, through, um, just signing on for LeadLock as well.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:11.000
Whitney Hodges: And really, like, the biggest source of these new clients at this point has been, um… her name is, uh, Tirza. So she is a former, like, venue owner, she's now, like, a venue sales coach, and she works really closely.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:19.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, with venues on, like, everything. Um, and so some of you may kind of have this, like, full context of, like.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:35.000
Whitney Hodges: she herself previously used the platform, um, Hitched, which is, like, just kind of, like, a big name in the wedding ad space, specifically for venues. They run Meta ads for them, they do everything in GHL.

