Whitney Hodges: what I am kind of envisioning, I think, and I think I kind of laid this out in my Slack message, was, um, Fallon, I would love for you to just kind of be, like, heading up what the overall strategy is. Like, I think probably by digging into Sunset Ridges sort of stuff, that was probably helpful.

